{"session_id": "41a97714-8af5-5652-928a-3def9b1a03e6", "messages": [{"message_id": "e7c6da84-8485-481a-b9c5-eb3c2cbd2545", "role": "user", "content": "你好", "session_id": "41a97714-8af5-5652-928a-3def9b1a03e6", "ts": "2026-03-10T10:58:08.263125", "thinking": null, "files": []}, {"message_id": "520a55d8-eb08-4876-b9c1-40cceaabcc0c", "role": "assistant", "content": "你好！有什么我可以帮助你的吗？", "session_id": "41a97714-8af5-5652-928a-3def9b1a03e6", "ts": "2026-03-10T10:58:08.263694", "thinking": null, "files": []}, {"message_id": "abb6e9df-835e-4c0b-a7cc-6a9a60909a5a", "role": "user", "content": "使用generate-policy 生产policy qing.liu@iglooinsure.com，其他用默认值", "session_id": "41a97714-8af5-5652-928a-3def9b1a03e6", "ts": "2026-03-10T10:59:08.500625", "thinking": null, "files": []}, {"message_id": "d169070f-52f6-4ada-96af-2ce7acc7d501", "role": "assistant", "content": "好的，保单已成功生成！\n\n我已经使用 `generate-policy` 技能，并为您指定的邮箱 `qing.liu@iglooinsure.com` 提交了保险申请。\n\n系统显示处理成功，状态码为 200。\n\n还有其他我可以帮助您的吗？", "session_id": "41a97714-8af5-5652-928a-3def9b1a03e6", "ts": "2026-03-10T10:59:08.501004", "thinking": null, "files": []}]}
